# Blood and Glory (windurst 87): Shantotto in Windurst Walls, the qm3 and Cailleach Bheur in Ifrit's Cauldron. A
# level-75 WAR (can equip the Pole of Trials: level 71, WAR in its jobs), with the pole already held at 300 weapon skill
# points (item wsp=300). The offer's skill edge (Staff 2299, under 230 a level: not offered; 2300: 445), the trade while
# the check holds (the pole: no trade handler in section 1, nothing), 445's finish with the pole held (no second pole:
# the Weapon Training Guide alone, begun), 446 with the pole held (param 2; option 0: nothing; option 1, held:
# nothing), the trades while accepted (a chip; the pole and a chip: nil; the pole at 300 points: 448, its finish takes
# the pole and gives the Map to the Annals of Truth), 449, the qm3 (the map, no annals: Cailleach Bheur pops, claimed,
# SENSE_OMINOUS_PRESENCE; the NM up: popFromQM false, nil), the kill (the map held: killed_wsnm 1), the qm3's Annals of
# Truth (killed_wsnm reset), the qm3 with both key items (nil; again once her body is gone: nil, no pop), 450 (completed: fame +20; the map, the annals and the
# guide taken; Retribution learned, RETRIBUTION_LEARNED; setPos 121, -3, 111), then completed: 343 and a trade
# (nothing). #offer (no pole held; level 71), #offer_guide, #offer_job and #offer_level take the offer's other arms,
# #abandon 446's other options without the pole, #wsp299 the trade's edge, #gm_nomap the qm3 and the NM without the map
# or without the quest.
# Defaults: Shantotto 164 (her script acts only for Class Reunion: never here); the qm3 NOTHING_OUT_OF_ORDINARY (no
# script; Ifrit's Cauldron's DefaultActions). Also named: Shantotto by the Curses quests (all three completed by GM: the Golem's 343
# replaceDefault answers under this quest's lines) and Trust: Shantotto (the Windurst Trust Permit: never here).
lists WindurstWalls/Shantotto/onTrigger WindurstWalls/Shantotto/onTrade WindurstWalls/onEventFinish/445 WindurstWalls/onEventFinish/446 WindurstWalls/onEventFinish/448 WindurstWalls/onEventFinish/450 IfritsCauldron/qm3/onTrigger
char zone=WindurstWalls pos=122.6,-3.0,111.6 job=WAR lvl=75
quest Windurst.CursesFoiledAgain1 completed
quest Windurst.CursesFoiledAgain2 completed
quest Windurst.CursesFoiledAGolem completed
skill Staff 2299
item BoneChip
item PoleOfTrials wsp=300
login
trigger Shantotto                                   # Staff 2299 (getCharSkillLevel / 10 is below 230): not offered; the Golem's 343
finish
skill Staff 2300
walk 122.6,-3.0,111.6
trade Shantotto PoleOfTrials x1                     # the check holds: no trade handler in section 1, nothing; the pole kept
trigger Shantotto                                   # can equip, Staff 2300, no guide: event 445 (oncePerZone)
finish                                              # the pole held: no second pole; the Weapon Training Guide; begun
trigger Shantotto                                   # accepted, no key items, the pole held: event 446 (0, Pole of Trials, 0, 0, 2)
finish option=0                                     # nothing
trigger Shantotto                                   # 446 again
finish option=1                                     # the pole held: nothing
walk 122.6,-3.0,111.6
trade Shantotto BoneChip x1                         # not the pole: nil
trade Shantotto PoleOfTrials x1 BoneChip x1         # the pole and a chip: not exact, nil
trade Shantotto PoleOfTrials x1                     # 300 weapon skill points: progressEvent 448 (0, 0, Annals of Truth)
finish                                              # the pole taken; the Map to the Annals of Truth
trigger Shantotto                                   # the map: event 449
finish
warp 118.8,20.0,141.8 IfritsCauldron
trigger qm3                                         # the map, no annals: Cailleach Bheur pops (claimed); SENSE_OMINOUS_PRESENCE
trigger qm3                                         # the NM spawned: popFromQM false, nil; NOTHING_OUT_OF_ORDINARY
kill CAILLEACH_BHEUR                                # the map held: local killed_wsnm 1
trigger qm3                                         # killed_wsnm 1: reset; the Annals of Truth
trigger qm3                                         # both key items, killed_wsnm 0: nil; NOTHING_OUT_OF_ORDINARY
tick 15000                                          # her body despawns (one zone tick per tick statement, as #gm_nomap)
tick 15000
tick 15000
trigger qm3                                         # both key items, she is gone: the annals held, so no pop; nil; NOTHING_OUT_OF_ORDINARY
warp 122.6,-3.0,111.6 WindurstWalls
trigger Shantotto                                   # the annals (and the map): progressEvent 450
finish                                              # completed; the key items taken; Retribution; RETRIBUTION_LEARNED; setPos 121, -3, 111
trigger Shantotto                                   # completed: no section; the Golem's 343
finish
walk 122.6,-3.0,111.6
trade Shantotto BoneChip x1                         # completed: no trade handler, nothing
